."}, "transit_specificity": {"answer": "yes", "evidence": "West Loop: Green and Pink Line... Illinois Medical District station; Fulton Market: Green Line and Pink Line; University Village/Little Italy: Blue Line... UIC-Halsted, Green Line or Pink Line from Ashland or Polk; Pilsen: Pink Line... stations like 18th, Paulina, Damen."}}, "usage": {"in": 3115, "out": 7727}, "ts": "2026-10-29T10:51:37.626404+00:00"}
